sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as Penghuni
  participant FE as Flutter Frontend
  participant API as API Gateway / TenantResolver
  participant Maint as Modul Maintenance
  participant EventBus as Internal Event Bus
  participant Sched as Modul Schedule Core
  participant Admin as Pengelola Gedung
  participant Notif as Modul Notification

  User->>FE: Input Komplain & Unggah Foto Kerusakan
  FE->>API: POST /api/maintenance (Multipart, X-Building-ID)
  API->>Maint: createDamageReport(buildingId, roomId, photoUrls, desc)
  
  Maint->>Maint: Simpan Tiket Kerusakan (status: 'pending')
  Maint->>EventBus: emit(LaporanKerusakanMasuk)
  
  EventBus->>Sched: handle(LaporanKerusakanMasuk)
  Note over Sched: Buat Jadwal 'type: maintenance'<br/>Kunci Kamar dari Reservasi Baru
  
  EventBus->>Notif: handle(LaporanKerusakanMasuk)
  Notif->>Admin: Kirim Notifikasi WhatsApp Tiket Baru ke Admin Gedung Terkait
  
  Admin->>FE: Buka Dashboard Maintenance & Tugaskan Teknisi
  FE->>API: PATCH /api/maintenance/{id}/assign
  API->>Maint: updateStatus('in_progress')
  
  Admin->>FE: Konfirmasi Perbaikan Selesai
  FE->>API: PATCH /api/maintenance/{id}/complete
  API->>Maint: updateStatus('completed')
  Maint->>EventBus: emit(JadwalMaintenanceSelesai)
  
  EventBus->>Sched: handle(JadwalMaintenanceSelesai)
  Sched->>Sched: Selesaikan Jadwal Maintenance (Bebaskan Kamar)
  
  EventBus->>Notif: handle(JadwalMaintenanceSelesai)
  Notif->>User: Kirim WhatsApp: "Fasilitas Selesai Diperbaiki"
